      <dct:created rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2016-02-10</dct:created>
      <rdf:value xml:lang="en">N-Quads is a line-based, plain text format for encoding an RDF dataset. N-quads statements are a sequence of RDF terms representing the subject, predicate, object and graph label of an RDF Triple and the graph it is part of in a dataset.</rdf:value>
      <dct:creator>W3C</dct:creator>
      <dct:source>https://www.w3.org/TR/n-quads/</dct:source>
      <euvoc:xlNote xml:lang="en">N-Quads is a line-based, plain text format for encoding an RDF dataset. N-quads statements are a sequence of RDF terms representing the subject, predicate, object and graph label of an RDF Triple and the graph it is part of in a dataset.</euvoc:xlNote>
   </euvoc:XlNote>
