      <rdf:value xml:lang="en">Formex 4 – from 1.5.2004: Structure language created and maintained by the Publications Office, on the basis of XML and Unicode as character set.</rdf:value>
      <euvoc:xlNote xml:lang="en">Formex 4 – from 1.5.2004: Structure language created and maintained by the Publications Office, on the basis of XML and Unicode as character set.</euvoc:xlNote>
