      <rdf:value xml:lang="en">Formex 2 1.1.1989–31.3.1999: Structure language created and maintained by the Publications Office, on the basis of SGML. The character encoding is organised according to ISO 2022 and ISO 8856.</rdf:value>
      <euvoc:xlNote xml:lang="en">Formex 2 1.1.1989–31.3.1999: Structure language created and maintained by the Publications Office, on the basis of SGML. The character encoding is organised according to ISO 2022 and ISO 8856.</euvoc:xlNote>
