      <dct:created rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2018-02-26</dct:created>
      <rdf:value xml:lang="en">SQL – Structured Query Language – is a domain-specific language used in programming and designed for managing data held in a relational database management system (RDBMS) or for stream processing in a relational data stream management system (RDSMS).</rdf:value>
      <dct:creator>Wikipedia</dct:creator>
      <euvoc:xlNote xml:lang="en">SQL – Structured Query Language – is a domain-specific language used in programming and designed for managing data held in a relational database management system (RDBMS) or for stream processing in a relational data stream management system (RDSMS).</euvoc:xlNote>
   </euvoc:XlNote>
