      <dct:created rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2015-04-20</dct:created>
      <rdf:value xml:lang="en">Esri ASCII grid is the media type which shall be used for ASCII GRID files. ASCII GRID is one of the two formats of Esri grid, a raster GIS file format, a non-proprietary ASCII format, also known as an ArcInfo ASCII GRID.</rdf:value>
