   <euvoc:XlNote rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/file-type/bda73e2a46f1d42925cced17242261a1">
      <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://publications.europa.eu/ontology/euvoc#XlNote"/>
      <euvoc:startDate rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">1982-01-01</euvoc:startDate>
      <dct:created rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2021-08-27</dct:created>
      <rdf:value xml:lang="en">A DWG file is a 2D or 3D drawing created with Autodesk AutoCAD, a professional CAD program. It contains vector image data and metadata that AutoCAD and other CAD applications use to load a drawing. DWG files are related to .DXF files, which are ASCII versions of DWG files.</rdf:value>
      <dct:creator>The File Information Database</dct:creator>
      <dct:source>https://fileinfo.com/extension/dwg</dct:source>
      <euvoc:xlNote xml:lang="en">A DWG file is a 2D or 3D drawing created with Autodesk AutoCAD, a professional CAD program. It contains vector image data and metadata that AutoCAD and other CAD applications use to load a drawing. DWG files are related to .DXF files, which are ASCII versions of DWG files.</euvoc:xlNote>
   </euvoc:XlNote>
