      <dct:created rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2015-04-20</dct:created>
      <rdf:value xml:lang="en">GDB is an Esri's file-based geodatabase format, stored as folders in a file system. It shall be used for Esri file geodatabases. The file is a zip archive that contains the gdb directory.</rdf:value>
      <dct:creator>Wikipedia | http://inspire.ec.europa.eu/media-types/</dct:creator>
      <euvoc:xlNote xml:lang="en">GDB is an Esri's file-based geodatabase format, stored as folders in a file system. It shall be used for Esri file geodatabases. The file is a zip archive that contains the gdb directory.</euvoc:xlNote>
   </euvoc:XlNote>
