      <dct:created rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2024-05-03</dct:created>
      <rdf:value xml:lang="en">Apache columnar format that includes a language-agnostic in-memory data structure specification, metadata serialisation, and a protocol for serialisation and generic data transport; streaming format is used for sending an arbitrary length sequence of record batches</rdf:value>
