      <rdf:value xml:lang="en">MapInfo TAB is the media type which shall be used for the MapInfo TAB format. The file is a zip archive that contains at least the tab, dat, map and id files.</rdf:value>
      <dct:creator>http://inspire.ec.europa.eu/media-types/</dct:creator>
