      <euvoc:xlNote xml:lang="en">XML – Extensible Markup Language – is a markup language that defines a set of rules for encoding documents in a format that is both human-readable and machine-readable. The design goals of XML emphasize simplicity, generality and usability across the Internet.</euvoc:xlNote>
   </euvoc:XlNote>
