      <dct:created rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2018-02-26</dct:created>
      <rdf:value xml:lang="en">PDF/A-1 is the Part 1 of the PDF standard and specifies two levels of conformance for PDF files. Level B (basic) conformance requires only that standards necessary for the reliable reproduction of a document's visual appearance be followed.</rdf:value>
      <dct:creator>Wikipedia</dct:creator>
      <euvoc:xlNote xml:lang="en">PDF/A-1 is the Part 1 of the PDF standard and specifies two levels of conformance for PDF files. Level B (basic) conformance requires only that standards necessary for the reliable reproduction of a document's visual appearance be followed.</euvoc:xlNote>
   </euvoc:XlNote>
