      <rdf:value xml:lang="en">MPEG-4 – Moving Picture Experts Group – Part 10, Advanced Video Coding is a block-oriented motion-compensation-based video compression standard. It is one of the most commonly used formats for the recording, compression and distribution of video content.</rdf:value>
